1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 26=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(I'll be your blade,
by your side till the end.)

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,480
You came seeking a marriage alliance.

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,480
I've entrusted my beloved daughter
to you.

6
00:00:21,073 --> 00:00:22,433
I've shown my sincerity.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,160
Now, where is yours?

8
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:27,950
Your Majesty.

9
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,310
Our Khan has said

10
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,190
that if we marry the princess,

11
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,910
our nations will never wage war again.

12
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:33,383
This...

13
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:35,390
is our greatest sincerity.

14
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:36,830
Greatest sincerity?

15
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:38,990
Bring it here.

16
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:48,643
(Imperial Capital Defense Map)

17
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:55,070
You pretend to seek peace
through marriage alliance,

18
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:56,630
yet your delegation

19
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:59,310
has been surveying my capital

20
00:01:00,296 --> 00:01:01,376
and spying on

21
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,570
the defenses of my imperial palace.

22
00:01:03,595 --> 00:01:04,670
This...

23
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:06,590
Is your idea of sincerity?

24
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:10,970
This...

25
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:14,410
(East, North, West, South Gates)
This is indeed the capital defense map.

26
00:01:15,616 --> 00:01:16,736
Beijie claims to seek
a marriage alliance,

27
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:17,683
but behind our backs,

28
00:01:17,836 --> 00:01:18,956
they resort to such treachery!

29
00:01:20,366 --> 00:01:21,726
You sue for peace on the surface,

30
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:22,750
but only to buy time.

31
00:01:23,303 --> 00:01:25,263
You use this sham marriage to lull me,

32
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:27,030
and tribute to rebuild your strength.

33
00:01:27,429 --> 00:01:28,789
Once you've regained your power,

34
00:01:29,303 --> 00:01:31,023
you'll surely break your word

35
00:01:31,047 --> 00:01:32,007
and invade us again!

36
00:01:32,876 --> 00:01:33,396
Your Majesty.

37
00:01:33,909 --> 00:01:35,189
I don't know what you mean.

38
00:01:35,436 --> 00:01:37,076
Are you trying to break the alliance,

39
00:01:37,323 --> 00:01:39,243
or frame our nation, Beijie?

40
00:01:39,776 --> 00:01:41,376
If Your Majesty breaks your word,

41
00:01:41,723 --> 00:01:44,123
our Beijie cavalry
will ride south at any time.

42
00:01:44,147 --> 00:01:44,707
And then,

43
00:01:45,869 --> 00:01:47,749
the princess will still be our Khan's.

44
00:01:47,996 --> 00:01:48,596
How dare you!

45
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:51,310
Move again,

46
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,390
and you'll lose your head!

47
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:52,990
Kneel!

48
00:02:02,970 --> 00:02:03,370
Your Majesty.

49
00:02:04,069 --> 00:02:05,076
Please spare my life!

50
00:02:05,490 --> 00:02:07,210
The Beijie envoy made me draw it.

51
00:02:07,336 --> 00:02:08,416
He paid us silver

52
00:02:08,723 --> 00:02:09,843
to secretly help him

53
00:02:10,003 --> 00:02:12,003
draw this defense map.

54
00:02:14,396 --> 00:02:16,869
- Your Majesty, spare us!
- Your Majesty, spare us!

55
00:02:18,269 --> 00:02:19,909
You pushed for this marriage,

56
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,080
claiming the treasury was empty,

57
00:02:22,496 --> 00:02:23,616
and supplies were scarce,

58
00:02:23,963 --> 00:02:25,283
leaving us no means to fight Beijie.

59
00:02:25,916 --> 00:02:26,836
You said marriage

60
00:02:27,050 --> 00:02:28,170
was our only way to peace.

61
00:02:28,636 --> 00:02:30,203
But I've already investigated.

62
00:02:30,990 --> 00:02:32,110
Last year's salt tax in Jiangnan

63
00:02:32,503 --> 00:02:33,983
was short by three million taels.

64
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:35,423
The northern army's funds

65
00:02:35,723 --> 00:02:37,403
were skimmed by half at every level.

66
00:02:38,096 --> 00:02:39,936
It all went into your own pockets!

67
00:02:40,303 --> 00:02:43,469
- Your Majesty, spare us!
- Your Majesty, spare us!

68
00:02:44,236 --> 00:02:45,376
You're afraid of war,

69
00:02:45,889 --> 00:02:47,609
not because the people would suffer,

70
00:02:48,496 --> 00:02:50,296
but because it would
cut off your profits!

71
00:02:51,456 --> 00:02:51,976
And now,

72
00:02:52,729 --> 00:02:54,729
you'd have me sacrifice my own daughter

73
00:02:54,753 --> 00:02:55,633
for your own gain.

74
00:02:55,803 --> 00:02:58,263
- Your Majesty, spare us!
- Your Majesty, spare us!

75
00:03:06,950 --> 00:03:07,590
Jinxuan.

76
00:03:08,390 --> 00:03:09,070
Tell me,

77
00:03:09,830 --> 00:03:10,150
are you afraid?

78
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,430
Father.

79
00:03:15,990 --> 00:03:17,390
I'm scared.

80
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:20,630
Doesn't father love Jinxuan most?

81
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:24,870
Why are you sending me so far away?

82
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:27,590
I'll behave, father.

83
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,310
I

84
00:03:29,334 --> 00:03:32,174
won't be naughty again, father.

85
00:03:56,230 --> 00:03:57,790
She is my daughter.

86
00:03:58,376 --> 00:04:00,896
If I can't even protect my own child,

87
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:02,310
what kind of father am I?

88
00:04:03,663 --> 00:04:05,823
If a man can't even protect his family,

89
00:04:06,003 --> 00:04:08,163
how can he claim to protect his people?

90
00:04:16,096 --> 00:04:17,856
I'd rather lead the army myself

91
00:04:18,056 --> 00:04:19,136
and die on the battlefield

92
00:04:20,016 --> 00:04:21,936
than use my own daughter's
flesh and blood

93
00:04:22,676 --> 00:04:24,876
to buy a moment of false peace!

94
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:26,830
By my decree.

95
00:04:27,956 --> 00:04:28,716
Effective immediately,

96
00:04:29,610 --> 00:04:31,210
the old marriage alliance policy
is abolished.

97
00:04:31,690 --> 00:04:33,170
I shall lead the army myself

98
00:04:34,010 --> 00:04:35,130
and wage war against Beijie

99
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,790
to protect the people of our lands!

100
00:04:37,756 --> 00:04:39,236
Long live Your Majesty!

101
00:05:01,616 --> 00:05:02,776
Your Highness, you've suffered.

102
00:05:03,210 --> 00:05:04,410
I'm here to see you.

103
00:05:05,323 --> 00:05:06,683
I'm no longer a consort.

104
00:05:07,696 --> 00:05:08,656
Don't call me that.

105
00:05:10,476 --> 00:05:11,396
Stay strong.

106
00:05:12,236 --> 00:05:13,336
We'll find a way.

107
00:05:13,776 --> 00:05:15,176
We can get you out of here.

108
00:05:16,663 --> 00:05:17,463
Out of here?

109
00:05:20,963 --> 00:05:22,923
Last time I left this place

110
00:05:23,336 --> 00:05:24,456
with immense hatred.

111
00:05:25,656 --> 00:05:27,496
I believed justice would prevail.

112
00:05:28,276 --> 00:05:29,356
Without justice,

113
00:05:29,683 --> 00:05:30,763
I'd rather die.

114
00:05:31,243 --> 00:05:32,483
So I fought.

115
00:05:33,316 --> 00:05:33,876
I struggled.

116
00:05:34,463 --> 00:05:35,343
I resisted.

117
00:05:37,056 --> 00:05:38,216
But in the end,

118
00:05:39,283 --> 00:05:40,563
the murderers

119
00:05:40,823 --> 00:05:42,223
still walk free,

120
00:05:42,656 --> 00:05:43,496
untouched,

121
00:05:43,983 --> 00:05:45,423
still enjoying their
status and privilege.

122
00:05:46,236 --> 00:05:47,276
While the innocent

123
00:05:48,116 --> 00:05:49,596
still die in vain.

124
00:05:50,563 --> 00:05:51,563
Is this world

125
00:05:52,203 --> 00:05:53,403
truly so dark?

126
00:05:54,683 --> 00:05:56,803
Is there no right or wrong anymore?

127
00:05:58,150 --> 00:05:59,630
I no longer know

128
00:06:00,696 --> 00:06:02,256
what reason I have

129
00:06:03,116 --> 00:06:04,756
to leave this place.

130
00:06:13,016 --> 00:06:13,816
Rong.

131
00:06:14,743 --> 00:06:16,383
You can get through this.

132
00:06:16,576 --> 00:06:18,236
You will see justice served.

133
00:06:19,383 --> 00:06:21,423
Ever since Lingxi left me,

134
00:06:21,790 --> 00:06:24,030
I've given everything I have

135
00:06:24,309 --> 00:06:25,549
to seek justice for her.

136
00:06:27,570 --> 00:06:29,490
But I've realized I can't do it.

137
00:06:31,610 --> 00:06:35,490
I don't even know why I'm still alive.

138
00:06:40,083 --> 00:06:41,083
You still have me.

139
00:06:41,583 --> 00:06:42,383
I'll stay by your side.

140
00:06:46,696 --> 00:06:47,456
Chengyan.

141
00:06:48,456 --> 00:06:49,216
I'm sorry.

142
00:06:50,590 --> 00:06:52,310
For making you hate me all these years.

143
00:06:53,029 --> 00:06:54,909
I never even apologized.

144
00:06:55,996 --> 00:06:57,636
I'm the one who should apologize.

145
00:06:59,003 --> 00:07:00,083
I came too late.

146
00:07:00,756 --> 00:07:03,796
I left you to face all this alone
for so long.

147
00:07:04,023 --> 00:07:05,783
Through all these ten years,

148
00:07:06,363 --> 00:07:07,643
I hated you.

149
00:07:08,689 --> 00:07:09,569
I resented you.

150
00:07:10,550 --> 00:07:11,710
I felt wronged.

151
00:07:13,716 --> 00:07:15,956
I refused to let it go.

152
00:07:17,656 --> 00:07:19,136
I held on to my resolve,

153
00:07:20,283 --> 00:07:21,483
studied medical texts,

154
00:07:22,136 --> 00:07:23,056
and mastered herbal medicine.

155
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:26,070
Step by step,
I entered the Imperial Hospital.

156
00:07:26,816 --> 00:07:29,616
I wanted to stand before you with honor,

157
00:07:30,196 --> 00:07:31,036
and make you see

158
00:07:32,543 --> 00:07:34,743
the man you'd so cruelly abandoned.

159
00:07:36,383 --> 00:07:37,783
I wanted to know if you regretted it.

160
00:07:37,976 --> 00:07:43,096
♪Wildflowers fade, sorrow flows unseen♪

161
00:07:43,789 --> 00:07:47,683
♪Sunset is like a painting,
quiet lanes concealed♪

162
00:07:47,707 --> 00:07:48,673
But the moment

163
00:07:49,623 --> 00:07:51,303
I saw you again,

164
00:07:52,596 --> 00:07:55,556
I knew all that hate and resentment

165
00:07:58,416 --> 00:07:59,296
had simply vanished.

166
00:08:01,823 --> 00:08:03,903
They were only reasons to see you again.

167
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:09,596
♪Years apart, I ask where you wander♪

168
00:08:09,596 --> 00:08:10,396
Chengyan.

169
00:08:13,063 --> 00:08:14,063
I regret it.

170
00:08:15,469 --> 00:08:17,949
The moment I told you
I'd enter the palace,

171
00:08:18,610 --> 00:08:20,010
I began to regret it.

172
00:08:20,656 --> 00:08:22,736
I've regretted it every single day.

173
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,650
But what good does regret do?

174
00:08:32,696 --> 00:08:33,536
It's too late.

175
00:08:36,183 --> 00:08:41,509
♪Bygone days of romance,
how could I forget your eyes♪

176
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:42,933
(Rong.)

177
00:08:43,926 --> 00:08:46,573
(I've watched you through
every rise and fall.)

178
00:08:47,460 --> 00:08:48,973
(I watched you drift)

179
00:08:49,106 --> 00:08:50,426
(like a fallen leaf in the harem.)

180
00:08:51,319 --> 00:08:52,226
(And I watched you)

181
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:54,397
(rise to power, admired by all.)

182
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,600
(But I know better than anyone)

183
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:59,006
(how much hardship you've endured.)

184
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,960
(When you tried to
bring down Concubine Qi)

185
00:09:01,984 --> 00:09:04,030
(and lay near death in your bed,)

186
00:09:04,326 --> 00:09:05,326
(I made a vow.)

187
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:08,360
(I'd stay by your side
for the rest of my life,)

188
00:09:08,563 --> 00:09:09,609
(protecting you,)

189
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,586
(and never let you be hurt again.)

190
00:09:13,853 --> 00:09:16,459
(This body of mine has nothing else,)

191
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,280
(only my skill in medicine.)

192
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,579
(For the rest of my life,)

193
00:09:21,006 --> 00:09:22,146
(I'll be your blade,)

194
00:09:22,946 --> 00:09:23,906
(by your side till the end.)

195
00:09:25,283 --> 00:09:31,343
♪Time flows on, washing the past away♪

196
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,720
Let's leave this place again.

197
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,720
This time, I'll be with you.

198
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:37,240
All right?

199
00:09:46,073 --> 00:09:47,193
Consort Rong.

200
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:49,039
Consort Rong!

201
00:09:49,186 --> 00:09:50,786
Jinxuan is here to see you!

202
00:09:51,233 --> 00:09:52,193
Jinxuan.

203
00:09:53,017 --> 00:09:53,817
Jinxuan.

204
00:09:54,759 --> 00:09:55,906
What are you doing here?

205
00:09:56,146 --> 00:09:57,186
Didn't you go to Beijie?

206
00:09:57,546 --> 00:09:59,506
No, I didn't go.

207
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,506
Father first told me to go,

208
00:10:01,853 --> 00:10:03,986
but then he flew into a rage

209
00:10:04,010 --> 00:10:05,970
and decided to keep me here.

210
00:10:06,553 --> 00:10:09,386
Father said no marriage alliance.

211
00:10:09,746 --> 00:10:11,626
He's going to war with our enemy.

212
00:10:11,650 --> 00:10:13,050
He'll fight them himself

213
00:10:13,074 --> 00:10:14,514
and protect his people.

214
00:10:14,658 --> 00:10:15,458
Good.

215
00:10:15,953 --> 00:10:16,753
Good.

216
00:10:17,293 --> 00:10:18,093
That's great.

217
00:10:18,166 --> 00:10:19,166
Consort Rong.

218
00:10:20,126 --> 00:10:21,759
I was so scared.

219
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:26,359
I thought I'd never see you again.

220
00:10:27,073 --> 00:10:28,993
I'll behave from now on.

221
00:10:29,233 --> 00:10:31,353
I won't cause trouble again.

222
00:10:33,126 --> 00:10:34,006
Good girl, Jinxuan.

223
00:10:34,146 --> 00:10:36,180
Don't cry.

224
00:10:37,179 --> 00:10:37,979
Jinxuan.

225
00:10:38,493 --> 00:10:39,773
Why did you come alone?

226
00:10:40,586 --> 00:10:42,826
Father said you'd be worried about me,

227
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:45,320
so he brought me here to see you.

228
00:11:01,710 --> 00:11:06,190
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

229
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:11,230
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

230
00:11:11,430 --> 00:11:16,030
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

231
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:20,870
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

232
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:25,630
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

233
00:11:26,069 --> 00:11:30,669
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

234
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:35,470
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

235
00:11:35,830 --> 00:11:40,430
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

236
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:45,190
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

237
00:11:45,470 --> 00:11:48,750
♪Let the stars and sea♪

238
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:50,070
(Changsheng Gate)

239
00:11:50,070 --> 00:11:53,950
♪Wait for your return♪
